WEBVTT

00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:06.410
From the Aloma Prophesy Grimoire, chapter 66, section 6:

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:11.220
Partners who do not dance together shall never cross paths again.

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:51.990
Angels and Demons Neko~n.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:56.020
It's spring! It's finally spring!

00:01:56.020 --> 00:01:59.210
Oh glorious students of Paprika Academy,

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:03.620
congratulations on your acceptance, advancement, or graduation.

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:07.270
With the beginning of the new school year comes the joy of making new friends,

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:11.730
helping them, supporting them, and occasionally fighting, but making up with them.

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:17.900
On top of that, devote yourself to your studies, sports, and PriPara!

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:18.310
Yes ma'am!

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:19.160
Capisce!
Yes ma'am!

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:23.920
I'm so happy that the principal is finally supporting us with PriPara!

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:26.370
It's a complete turnaround from last year.

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:28.450
Note: This is referring to the game of Go.

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:31.620
I hope she'll finish up soon.

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:32.760
Right, Leona?

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:33.340
Yeah.

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:35.340
You! Don't take that off just because it's hot!

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:36.890
School rule number 22:

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:37.470
School outfits must always be neat and clean!

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:39.050
Pushuu~.

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:42.760
<i>You're as distinguished and cool as ever, President Minami.</i>

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:49.810
Now extend your wings and quickly fly towards your shining future!

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:52.980
Yes! Just like me!

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:55.390
Fly forth, youth!

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:58.610
We're in the same class again.
It's been a while! What's up?

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:01.440
We're 6th graders now!

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:02.180
Yeah!

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:03.800
I'm so happy we're in the same class again!

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:04.500
I'm so happy!

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:05.370
Capisce!

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:08.610
But our studies are going to be more difficult, huh?

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:12.170
We'll just have to do our best like the principal said.

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:15.980
Too bad we can't live off just doing PriPara.

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:16.790
Get real.

00:03:18.110 --> 00:03:20.120
After reforming SoLaMi Smile,

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:22.640
I'll have to work hard for the new event.

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:25.060
The PriPara Dream Parade, right?

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:26.810
I'll be cheering for you, Lala.

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:29.270
Thanks, capisce!

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:33.850
Dream Theater-usa?

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:35.730
Five person teams-kuma?

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:36.540
Oh well.

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:42.170
It doesn't matter what system they use,
SoLaMi Smile will still end up winning-kuma.

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:46.700
And at that point they'll go down as legends in PriPara's history books-kuma.

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:52.210
Cyalume Change!

00:03:53.060 --> 00:03:55.810
They're miles above the rest-kuma!

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:59.400
Even if you say that, the same goes for Dressing Parfait-usa.

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:02.130
They will find themselves in the history books as well-usa.

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:05.800
Dressing Parfait will be the ones to ride on the lead float,

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:09.350
and ring the Charm Bell of Beginnings-usa.

00:04:09.570 --> 00:04:12.250
No, no. It'll be SoLaMi Smile-kuma!

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:15.500
You should just recruit the two over there.

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:16.220
Huh?

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:16.860
How rude.

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:18.610
That's my line-usa!

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:20.250
Don't take Dressing Parfait lightly-usa!

00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:21.250
Huh?

00:04:22.730 --> 00:04:29.460
<i>Nyello.</i>

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:38.300
Oh my.

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:41.090
Look at the two hunks-nekon.

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:45.160
She's charming!

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:50.180
Would the two of you like to come back to my place?

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:52.780
Hunks are always welcome-nekon.

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:54.040
I-I'll go-kuma!

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:55.350
Me too!
I-I'll go-kuma!

00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:01.690
I'm sure you're both thirsty after spending the day in the sun-nekon.

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:03.650
Please help yourselves.

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:07.290
So is this your bar-kuma?

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:10.350
The atmosphere suits you perfectly-usa.

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:11.870
It's very stylish-kuma.

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:14.850
What smooth talkers.

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:17.180
You may call me Neko-neesan-nekon.

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:18.330
We'd love to!

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:23.010
What stupid lumps of cotton.

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:26.230
They've completely fallen into my trap.

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:29.180
This pizza bun is delicious~.

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:30.930
Is that so-nekon?

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:36.890
I want to celebrate meeting two wonderful hunks by giving you a free fortune telling-nekon.

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:41.360
I'm sure we'll see a lovely future-nekon.

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:43.410
O-Our fortune-kuma?

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:46.820
But fortune tellings aren't real-usa.

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:49.380
Devidevi~nyan devidevi~nyan.

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:54.040
Tell me what the future has in store for these two hunks-nekon.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.750
Take a look at your lovely futures-nekon.

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:09.050
PriPara change, complete!

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:12.970
Complete-pri!

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:14.970
Finished~.

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:16.300
Pushuu~.

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:18.810
All right, let's get to reforming SoLaMi Smile,

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:20.520
and have our first concert-pri!

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:26.650
Promise: Believe in friendship.

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:28.610
Rythem: Carved in our hearts.

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:31.070
Paradise: Our goal.

00:06:31.480 --> 00:06:34.290
We swear to stand on stage as one.

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:37.750
We'd like to enter as SoLaMi Smile!

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:39.710
You can't do a live.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:40.790
Eh?!

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:42.050
Why-pri?!

00:06:42.050 --> 00:06:44.750
We just took our reformation oath!

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:48.420
Even without Kuma, I thought we could enter as idols-pri!

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:52.280
The system isn't recognising your reformation.

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:53.830
What?!

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:57.140
You didn't have a witness for the oath you just took.

00:06:57.140 --> 00:06:58.390
Witness?

00:06:58.390 --> 00:06:59.800
What do we need one for-pri?

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:03.300
The ritual requires a witness.

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:05.320
Basically that means your manager.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:05.940
I never heard about that!

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:08.010
This is news to me-pri.

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:10.530
Please come back once you're reformed.

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:12.460
We're counting on you!

00:07:13.930 --> 00:07:16.990
I can't believe it had a catch like that-pri...

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:20.360
Go'.

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:21.960
Have you entered already?

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:23.670
We're going to do it right now.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:26.630
We took the ritual to the max.

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:29.650
Well...

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:31.060
You pri and pri.

00:07:31.060 --> 00:07:32.600
Yada yada.

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:33.200
Pri.

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:34.270
What?!

00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:36.310
The oath requires a witness?!

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:38.440
I see.

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:39.770
Now that I think about it...

00:07:40.950 --> 00:07:43.150
Usagi was there when we did it back then.

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:45.290
Same here-pri.

00:07:46.130 --> 00:07:49.160
They never told us anything about it-pri.

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:52.460
I guess that means we need to get ourselves a manager quickly.

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:56.190
Speaking of, I haven't seen Kuma-san for a while.

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:57.950
We neither.

00:07:57.950 --> 00:07:59.750
You neither?!

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:03.170
Kuma!

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:03.920
Usa!

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.540
M-My hair!

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:07.830
It all fell out-usa!

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:11.340
No!

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:12.630
My my.

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:15.110
Here I thought we'd see a lovely future,

00:08:15.110 --> 00:08:17.480
but it seems you're cursed-nekon.

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:19.140
Cursed-usa?
Cursed-kuma?

00:08:19.340 --> 00:08:21.500
Ah! Could it be you two...

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:24.600
...haven't found who you'll team up with-nekon?

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:26.890
O-Of course we have.

00:08:26.890 --> 00:08:30.390
Regardless of what happens, I'll be with Dressing Parfait-usa.

00:08:30.390 --> 00:08:33.760
I won't lose to some curse-kuma!

00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:36.320
I'll rise to the top with SoLaMi Smile-kuma!

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:38.160
Is that so?

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:43.480
The PriPara System won't let you reform with the same team.

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:45.120
PriPara System-usa?
PriPara System-kuma?

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:46.390
That's right-neko!

00:08:46.390 --> 00:08:49.840
The system is predictable,
so when it's upset, there'll be problems.

00:08:50.140 --> 00:08:50.830
Really-usa?

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:52.170
Kuma?
Really-usa?

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:55.550
B-But why would the system be upset-usa?

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:57.510
That's because...

00:08:57.510 --> 00:09:01.500
...teaming up with the same members wouldn't suit two hunks like you-nekon.

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:04.940
It wants you to aim higher, so the universe...

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:07.400
...is mad-nekon.

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:09.890
We're definitely hunks, but...

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:11.730
B-But...

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:14.360
Curses aren't real-usa!

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:16.560
I understand.

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:19.610
I used to think that too-nekon.

00:09:19.610 --> 00:09:24.330
I've seen a lot of other men who've said the same thing.

00:09:25.050 --> 00:09:28.680
But you see, Wani-san from section 1, Ahiru-san from section 6,

00:09:28.680 --> 00:09:31.930
Matilda-san down in house 31, Tanuki-san in the suburbs,

00:09:31.930 --> 00:09:38.610
Risu-san up near the mountains, Yooderu-san downtown, Ottose-san out on country road 3-10...

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:41.100
Stop-usa!

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:42.840
But a fortune...

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:44.230
A curse...
But a fortune...

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:48.940
It breaks my heart knowing you don't believe me-nekon...

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:53.530
You're calling me a liar-neko?

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:55.060
I'd never-kuma.

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:56.860
I'd never say something like that-usa.

00:09:56.860 --> 00:10:00.570
Then it means I was lying when I said you were hunks, too.

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:01.870
Crap!

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:07.150
Your bill is 100,000 Pen.

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:12.000
Also, don't tell anyone about it if you don't want it to come true-nekon.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:18.880
Nekon! Nekon!

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:21.360
Nekon!

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:25.230
My nether disciple. Thou art our manager.

00:10:25.230 --> 00:10:26.350
Well done.

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:34.320
We Alomagedon will do whatever it takes to win the Dream Theatre and become the Parade Princess.

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:36.470
You devil.

00:10:36.470 --> 00:10:38.900
But it's best to leave it to me.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:44.170
In any case, our plan to prevent the reformation of SoLaMi Smile and Dressing Parfait is going well.

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:45.840
Those guys are free.

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:49.620
My Angel, now is the time to lead them into temptation!

00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:51.000
Gel!

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:56.160
So that we, the Alomagedon, may stand at the peak of idolism,

00:10:56.160 --> 00:11:01.210
I will form the perfect five person team which shall create the heavens and the earth!

00:11:01.210 --> 00:11:04.220
We must get ourselves another three members.

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:06.720
First I'll capture the angel, Manaka Lala!

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:07.430
Capisce!

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:09.870
Second shall be the demon, Dorthy West!

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:10.390
Chuu~.

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:12.640
And last shall be a mixture of both, Toudou Shion!

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:13.440
Go!

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:15.610
Be it white or black, I delight in them both.

00:11:15.930 --> 00:11:18.710
The devil desires these three.

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:20.380
Temptation Angel!

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:21.580
Nekon!

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:23.520
The wheel of fate has begun to spin.

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:25.580
It can no longer be stopped.

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:28.260
This shall be the final war between angels and demons.

00:11:28.260 --> 00:11:31.620
And it will give birth to the greatest
Dream Team the world has ever known!

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:32.680
Nano!

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:33.580
Nekon!

00:11:34.140 --> 00:11:35.180
Its name shall be:

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:37.310
Dream Alomagedon!

00:11:51.110 --> 00:11:53.150
We can't reform?

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:57.580
When it comes to reforming...

00:11:57.580 --> 00:11:59.610
You don't need to be in a rush-kuma.

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:01.550
What do you mean?
What do you mean-pri?

00:12:01.550 --> 00:12:03.570
We want to reform right away!

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:04.840
Impossible-pri!

00:12:04.840 --> 00:12:06.380
No, it's impossible-usa!
No, it's impossible-kuma!

00:12:06.380 --> 00:12:09.790
If you reform...

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:13.350
...a terrible curse will befall us-usa!
...a terrible curse will befall us-kuma!

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:15.200
A curse?

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:16.210
What are you talking about-pri?

00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:19.770
There's no way that'll happen!

00:12:19.770 --> 00:12:20.880
It's unscientific!

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:22.730
That's what we kept saying!

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:24.440
That's something non-believers would do!

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:27.070
But millions have been affected by this curse-usa!

00:12:27.070 --> 00:12:28.470
What kind of curse-pri?

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:29.430
Tell us-pri!

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:35.440
<i>Also, don't tell anyone about it if you don't want it to come true-nekon.</i>

00:12:35.710 --> 00:12:37.650
Anything but that-usa!
Anything but that-kuma!

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:38.730
Out with it!

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:39.610
Stop!

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:41.570
I don't get it-pri.

00:12:41.850 --> 00:12:43.150
Hold on...

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:46.390
The ones who'll be cursed are Kuma and Usagi.

00:12:46.390 --> 00:12:47.530
Usa?!
Kuma?!

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:50.120
That means we have nothing to worry about.

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:51.740
All right, let's reform.

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:53.680
If you say so, Dorthy.

00:12:53.680 --> 00:12:54.080
Usa!
Kuma!

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:55.540
That's true.

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:58.990
My calculations show that we'll be fine if we make a few sacrifices.

00:12:58.990 --> 00:13:00.800
All right, take your PriTickets out.

00:13:01.030 --> 00:13:04.260
Promise: Believe in friendship.

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:06.580
Rythem: Carved in our hearts.

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:07.970
Paradise: Our go-

00:13:10.150 --> 00:13:12.660
There's no way we're going to watch-usa!
There's no way we're going to watch-kuma!

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:13.560
Hold it!

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:14.600
Pushuu~.

00:13:16.740 --> 00:13:17.690
Not here.

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:19.750
A curse? You've got to be kidding-pri!

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:23.460
We'll finish the ritual even if we have to tie them up when we catch them!

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:25.870
Let's split up and search for them-pri!

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:27.130
Yeah!
Capisce!

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:32.520
Geez! I just don't get what Kuma-san is thinking!

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.250
Kuma-san!  Where are you?!

00:13:36.490 --> 00:13:37.310
Huh?

00:13:38.260 --> 00:13:45.420
Kuma-san?

00:13:47.390 --> 00:13:48.490
Where am I?

00:13:48.490 --> 00:13:50.740
That is far enough.

00:13:50.740 --> 00:13:52.560
W-What?

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:53.140
Wha?!

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:55.100
It's just a weather charm!

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:57.900
Geez, looked just like him, too!

00:13:57.900 --> 00:14:01.570
Yes, just like that foolish lump of cotton.

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:05.030
I met you yesterday. You're...

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:06.570
..the demon!

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:09.040
Yes, I am the demon Aloma.

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:10.650
Aloma-chan!

00:14:10.650 --> 00:14:12.090
I'm Lala.

00:14:12.090 --> 00:14:14.370
Turn your face in the direction of hell.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:15.540
H-Hell?

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:16.460
Down!

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:17.380
Down?

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:21.900
Oh? What's this?

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:23.440
A magic circle.

00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:23.960
Huh?

00:14:24.240 --> 00:14:26.470
I've caught you in my magic!

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:27.930
Derodero Derosaimu!

00:14:28.640 --> 00:14:29.650
Hah?

00:14:29.650 --> 00:14:30.450
Eh?

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:31.200
Huh?

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:31.640
Wha?

00:14:31.940 --> 00:14:34.890
Ye shall not escape from my magic!

00:14:35.440 --> 00:14:39.250
Thine actions shall be in accordance with this prophecy.

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:44.900
Two demons, two angels, and one who is a mixture of both shall open the gates of heaven and hell...

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:47.130
...and let ring the sound of heavenly gospels.

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:50.910
On the day of our judgement, we shall fly into the distant skies.

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:53.240
So! I have no idea what you're talking about!

00:14:57.170 --> 00:14:58.310
Jello!

00:14:59.050 --> 00:15:02.750
Aloma said let's form a five person Dream Team.

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:05.710
And it's name shall be Dream Alomagedon!

00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:07.410
An Aloma bowl?

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:11.280
Not a bowl!

00:15:11.280 --> 00:15:12.590
That's not "an", either.

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:14.300
Now,

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:17.250
you shall become our partner.

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:18.770
Let's get along-nano.

00:15:19.280 --> 00:15:23.410
If you choose not to, that bear shall suffer under a curse.

00:15:23.410 --> 00:15:24.360
Huh?!

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:26.610
Let's be happy!

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:28.940
Let's have your answer!

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:30.450
Come on! Out with it!

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:33.200
Are you okay with him suffering under a curse?

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:35.490
If you say yes, he'll be saved.

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:37.950
Come on! That's enough already!

00:15:38.390 --> 00:15:40.820
I'm SoLaMi Smile's Lala!

00:15:40.820 --> 00:15:42.620
I won't give into something like a curse!

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:47.590
I want to be with Mirelle and Sophie forever and ever!

00:15:48.610 --> 00:15:51.090
Oh, well said.

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:54.430
This is exactly why one such as you is worth tempting.

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:58.780
We had a little fun in place of our greeting today.

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:01.790
Thoroughly cleanse your soul and wait for us!

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:05.980
By that she means we'll be making our idol début today, so come watch us.

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:14.120
H-Huh?

00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:15.450
They're gone?

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:18.340
What's with them?

00:16:18.340 --> 00:16:19.950
Geez.

00:16:26.470 --> 00:16:29.590
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:31.720
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:34.540
Coord Change Start!

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:38.260
Mikan-chan's theme is obviously that of an angel.

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:42.590
One's heart will be cleansed by the purity of its light green and white colours.

00:16:42.590 --> 00:16:44.690
Sweet Angel White Coord!

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:46.630
Gel!

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:50.500
Aloma's theme is obviously that of a devil.

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:54.300
The aggressive design of the skirt will snatch away the eyes of any who gaze upon it.

00:16:54.300 --> 00:16:57.040
Cheeky Little Succubus Coord!

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:58.840
Debi!

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:06.380
Wonderful!

00:17:06.380 --> 00:17:07.290
So cute!

00:17:08.110 --> 00:17:08.640
Cute!

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:09.250
Do your best!

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:10.650
Darkness!

00:17:10.650 --> 00:17:12.300
This is our first battle!

00:17:14.690 --> 00:17:15.870
Shining!

00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:17.760
Please listen.

00:17:18.270 --> 00:17:22.220
Those who pass through PriPara's gate, abandon all hope!

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:27.060
No, an angel shall save your soul!

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:28.730
Aloma and...

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:29.480
Mikan...

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:31.760
An angel and demon...

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:34.150
...shall take you to heaven.

00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:35.780
No, to hell.

00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:37.970
They're funny!

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:38.780
Take me!

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:41.030
Not bad-pri.

00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:48.480
Alomagedon's "Devi & Reversible-Ring".

00:19:00.190 --> 00:19:03.530
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:08.490
Go, my servants!

00:19:11.220 --> 00:19:12.460
Huh?

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:19.350
Dazzling PriParapedia Labyrinth!

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:25.930
Cyalume Change!

00:19:31.490 --> 00:19:32.440
Debi!

00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:16.570
That was great.

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:17.750
They're pretty good.

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:18.670
Yeah.

00:20:18.670 --> 00:20:21.150
I can't believe this is their first concert.

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:23.760
An angel and demon...

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:26.870
An existence that runs contrary to itself, just like Go.

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:28.830
Neko-neesan-kuma.

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:33.290
Neko-neesan is quite the manager-usa.

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:39.450
Purple.

00:20:39.450 --> 00:20:41.010
Aloma-chan has cool.

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:47.430
Pink.

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:49.130
Mikan-chan has lovely.

00:20:49.860 --> 00:20:54.810
I'm sure you two could form a team quickly if you look for three more members.

00:20:55.890 --> 00:20:57.250
Amazing!

00:20:57.250 --> 00:21:00.320
They rose to upcoming idols right after they made their PriPara début!

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:04.270
Alomagedon has given us a smashing début.

00:21:09.310 --> 00:21:11.820
What a splendid debut-neko.

00:21:11.820 --> 00:21:13.680
You've increased your charm-nekon.

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:14.910
Well of course.

00:21:14.910 --> 00:21:15.790
Nekon.

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:20.840
Crap!

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:21.970
Huh?

00:21:21.970 --> 00:21:22.990
What is it?

00:21:22.990 --> 00:21:24.190
Lala?

00:21:25.370 --> 00:21:28.010
<i>Let's go to heaven together.</i>

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:30.720
<i>Thus begins our trip to hell.</i>

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:32.460
W-What should I do?!

00:21:32.460 --> 00:21:34.680
It's no longer capisce!

00:23:05.660 --> 00:23:08.990
You've got to be joking if you think you can just scout Lala-pri.

00:23:08.990 --> 00:23:12.450
Nothing you do can go against a demon's prophecy!

00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:13.530
Demon?

00:23:13.530 --> 00:23:14.870
They don't exist-pri.

00:23:14.870 --> 00:23:16.010
You're making me laugh-pri.

00:23:16.010 --> 00:23:19.190
Then my curse shall befall you as well!

00:23:19.190 --> 00:23:21.440
Like I said, curses don-

00:23:21.440 --> 00:23:22.600
H-Huh?

00:23:22.600 --> 00:23:24.960
Strange things are happening one after another!

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:26.420
Could they be real?!

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:29.060
I miscalculated-pri!

00:23:29.060 --> 00:23:29.670
Next time:

00:23:29.670 --> 00:23:31.660
A Cursed Solo Concert-pri!

00:23:31.660 --> 00:23:33.100
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:33.100 --> 00:23:34.640
Let's go PriPara!
